<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged up to 22,350 per dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged up to 22,350 per dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged up to 22,350 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 22,380 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  February 7	 February 6</p>
<p> Belar rouble rate to dollar	 22,350	     22,380</p>
<p> Volume traded			$1.505 mln	 $0.667 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
